,"amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"You can read silently, just wanted to let you know that an official Ditto Switch controller is now on pre-orders, I know you like ditto:_irysHeart2: take a good rest"},{"t":12813,"who":"@kalen.","id":"UCCWqNkG-ksQrYLd04bCg-ZQ","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"IRyS I’m cominggggg wait for meee:_irysHeart: I’ve been so overworked with so little sleep recently, but it’s all gonna be worth it :_irysHeart2: IRyS fighto!! IRyS no.1!! IRyS DAISUKI. See you soon!"},{"t":12906,"who":"@tuckhoe161","id":"UCWRRHA-iTSea6QyMqrQ9jmw","k":"sc","cur":"MYR","amt":30,"c":4294953512,"m":"just a few more days, went to see all the ADs, so many people gathering all around the world to be here for you and everything I feel so proud of you! Good luck, I will be cheering out loud for you!"},{"t":13052,"who":"@PhakesL","id":"UCziWZqLJhp8nlPKG_yE0Luw","k":"sc","cur":"THB","amt":200,"c":4294953512,"m":"I'm flying to Japan tonight,can't wait to actually meet IRyStrocrats and get to see the concert in person! I hope you have a good well rest. also sorry to hear about psychiatric, I'm glad you changed."},{"t":13070,"who":"@lAngelingl","id":"UCs_6i74QKt25j75l_34dKPQ","k":"sc","cur":"SGD","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":":_irysHeart2::_irysHeart2: thank you for the Happy Birthday wish IRyS. you really made my day! also for psychiatrists, if you cant trust him, change him out like old clothes!"},{"t":13114,"who":"@ClankyPick811","id":"UCIqjgha6U3PP5i0ZXPajmyA","k":"milestone","tier":"IRySoCool","m":"Member for 15 months"},{"t":13136,"who":"@IDrinkCoffeeBlack","id":"UCk6ZiV4kXXbvJA7gokzrRTw","k":"sc","cur":"SGD","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"IRyS, whats the one thing you are going to do after the sololive? :eyes: also, it feels like time flew and its now your sololive! Go out there and break a leg! (figuratively, not literally)! "},{"t":13157,"who":"@wellyjohnny6155","id":"UCoBn2XTm1jlPtUQGUaUKq7Q","k":"sc","cur":"IDR","amt":100000,"c":4294953512,"m":"If you ever feel nervous about your first concert just remember about BIPOOP Accident LOL"},{"t":13158,"who":"@joshdirect","id":"UCAbiHhOG_yOyuTiFvv_c06g","k":"milestone","tier":"IRySoCool","m":"Member for 58 months"},{"t":13239,"who":"@ChaChi444","id":"UCgdniT0jLQZwwUZP653q6Bw","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":1.99,"c":4278248959,"m":"Thanks for the fun (and funny) stream Irys :sparkling_heart::sparkling_heart:"},{"t":13263,"who":"@彦Yan278","id":"UCaFkj3XN5Wx744ID-NptCzg","k":"sc","cur":"NT$","amt":300,"c":4294278144,"m":"HiRys, I just receive the vinyl record. It was really nice. Have you try to listen to the vinyl yet?"},{"t":13263,"who":"@Mavjin8","id":"UCd9uXwjIbv9zhd_oy_Scoww","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":50,"c":4293467747,"m":"If this is the last time we see you beforehand, break a leg next week! Just think, in a week it'll already be over, but it'll have been amazing. As punishment for not going in person, karma has hit me with needing to go to the dentist soon."},{"t":13272,"who":"@ReneAlarkyun","id":"UC8yw8hrcKbaS2wbnNvCLVhg","k":"sc","cur":"MX$","amt":100,"c":4294953512,"m":"Getting ready for travel. Making an ita bag is harder than it looks.I have pricked my fingers a few times. But it's worth it for the show. Have a good rest now while possible cuz who knows tomorrow."},{"t":13295,"who":"@SamWrit3-R","id":"UC7MY503k0xqtNNs1wnU-1dw","k":"sc","cur":"€","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"Sololive coming soon, see you there! By the way, thanks for the good suggestions! I’ll definitely check out the bathrooms first when I arrive in Tokyo! :face_with_tears_of_joy:"},{"t":13327,"who":"@KiraTheMaster","id":"UCBZewN-y9UGo90zVCsV-jFw","k":"sc","cur":"€","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"I'm really sorry you had such a bad experience with your psychiatrist. There are jerks everywhere, even among doctors.I'm leaving for Japan in a few hours. I can't wait to see you, my push :_irysHeart2:"},{"t":13328,"who":"@renaレナだよ","id":"UCV95ooDkn32tmMwNN3JyZ6g","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":2,"c":4278248959,"m":"best of luck at show, i got S tickets!"},{"t":13346,"who":"@ClankyPick811","id":"UCIqjgha6U3PP5i0ZXPajmyA","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":9.99,"c":4294953512,"m":"HiRyS! Yesterday was my 25th birthday so could I get a happy birthday from my oshi? Hope you have a great day and good luck with the concert prep! I know you got this!"},{"t":13434,"who":"@Ottobon","id":"UC_egjdqHz-lBAS65a6GvitQ","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"You are a great, a grand senpai to EN. Unrelated if prep is fun remember that for PT, sometimes just moving in fun ways is better exercise silly weights. Look forward to concert!"},{"t":13438,"who":"@Frozenfaux","id":"UCn7mSUL8Ga_HJsG9LbeVrVA","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":19.99,"c":4294278144,"m":"Cant wait for the concert got my flight ticket ready, concert ticket ready and the concert merch finally arrived now just need to wait for the big moment"},{"t":13454,"who":"@oveRayster","id":"UCfAEQCfUk0PbDhpQSP6JBTA","k":"sc","cur":"HK$","amt":100,"c":4294278144,"m":"poor IRyS, I'm sorry to hear u had a very bad time... I hope today's laugh & the coming live will make u feel even more better and happy! Fly to JP tomorrow! Can't wait to have the blast time with u in the live!:sparkling_heart: Ganbattene!"},{"t":13478,"who":"@philiper89","id":"UCy3vBYWIXdSXCy3vEhtbCMA","k":"sc","cur":"MYR","amt":150,"c":4293467747,"m":"Hi IRyS, congratulation to your 1st Live! My \"first time\" (superchat) sent to you. I will be flying today and arrive Tokyo tomorrow! I am so excited to see you soon!"},{"t":13504,"who":"@Xavier7392","id":"UCL1g-KP_uoVUqu_z01r-H6Q","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"your concert will be great IRyS, as the song goes \"you only got one chace do not miss your chance to blow This opportunity comes once in a lifetime\" with that said just lose yourself in the music IRyS"},{"t":13552,"who":"@datemaki_9","id":"UCNrfBanP1PaoQQ-jgsqgoFw","k":"sc","cur":"¥","amt":15800,"c":4293271831,"m":"配信お疲れ様です！！コンサートなのですが…抽選も落ち、一般で負け､どうしようかと思っていたらなんと！ご好意が重なり現地参加出来ることになりました！！！！三日後ステージでIRySが輝くところを目に焼き付けられるのを、めちゃくちゃ楽しみにしてますね！！！"},{"t":13585,"who":"@Hitogami116","id":"UCPSabEeuJK_Abduiu4HRh_g","k":"sc","cur":"MYR","amt":30,"c":4294953512,"m":"So, did you answer your concert countdown question correctly...?What was the first song you sang in your first ever karaoke stream?"},{"t":13705,"who":"@Wrixne","id":"UCKrFszHFVOW2G991UDJhcjg","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":99.99,"c":4293271831,"m":"(Save your voice). Sorry to hear about your negative doctor experience. The highest caliber providers hear and validate your concerns and make sure you feel and know they truly have your best interests in mind. Not “their” best interests or airing “their” superiority."},{"t":13770,"who":"@nakaojii","id":"UC7BSyED5S1MDUstYWDD3pZQ","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":10,"c":4294953512,"m":"Cant wait for the sololive!!:_irysHeart2::_irysHeart2:"},{"t":13987,"who":"@KyleKennedy-sk5mq","id":"UCHG8Sw1JUYZIGQfjxMcL-Hw","k":"sc","cur":"A$","amt":5,"c":4280150454,"m":"HiRys IRyS I'm hoping we can play mario kart world together "},{"t":14047,"who":"@KuMa93257","id":"UCEZpBMbB0zR-JVuRooX72FA","k":"sc","cur":"NT$","amt":670,"c":4294278144,"m":"Solo live がんばって！！"},{"t":14458,"who":"@The_soulgazer","id":"UCS_mCD84cQeaDCSE98OYl-g","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":19.99,"c":4294278144,"m":"Flying out in a couple hours! Take care and see you at the sololive!"},{"t":14495,"who":"@CrizzzB312","id":"UCLPyAS6mNkMv_1yyESlwk-Q","k":"milestone","tier":"IRySoCool","m":"Member for 4 months"},{"t":14519,"who":"@KyleKennedy-sk5mq","id":"UCHG8Sw1JUYZIGQfjxMcL-Hw","k":"sc","cur":"A$","amt":5,"c":4280150454,"m":"IRyS what will you do next live stream I'm getting excited "},{"t":14659,"who":"@KuMa93257","id":"UCEZpBMbB0zR-JVuRooX72FA","k":"milestone","tier":"IRySoCool","m":"Member for 1 month"},{"t":14681,"who":"@Wrixne","id":"UCKrFszHFVOW2G991UDJhcjg","k":"sc","cur":"$","amt":9.99,"c":4294953512,"m":"Lighter note. Can you say “Do you need a bag?” in Japanese? Context. I get thrown off at the konbini when they open with that. I stare like a fish. Then they motion with their hands a bag."},{"t":14839,"who":"@Miguel_Macias1","id":"UCCsSo5MEDJJrAYl1nrSuHrQ","k":"sc","cur":"MX$","amt":100,"c":4294953512,"m":"im rewatching rezero cuz i wanna watch the latest season and in s1 ep4 subaru says EMT Emilia maji tenshi... was TMT a reference this whole time? or is this something common in jp? IMT Irys maji tensh"},{"t":14910,"who":"@Anh_RyStocrat","id":"UCo34ldJJ8AVpWW1M2vX8bpQ","k":"sc","cur":"CA$","amt":50,"c":4293467747,"m":"(Save your voice) I'm flying out in less than 12 hours, so nervous and excited, I'm nervcited! I hope you can get some good rest before the concert. I'm gonna be so emotional seeing you on that big stage, you'll e the brightest star shining that day"},{"t":14964,"who":"@tuckhoe161","id":"UCWRRHA-iTSea6QyMqrQ9jmw","k":"sc","cur":"MYR","amt":30,"c":4294953512,"m":"btw first time experiencing typhoon (not really typhoon just strong wind and rain) and earthquake (on the 29th 5am) in Japan, thanks to your sololive ww"},{"t":15020,"who":"@ゆあち-Yuachi","id":"UCgNadgzurDJLGJiB9UXJy0A","k":"sc","cur":"¥","amt":2000,"c":4294278144,"m":"IRySのソロライブが楽しみすぎて、こっちまでドキドキしてます:_irysHeart2:全力で応援してます！！:_irysCheer::_irysCheer2:"},{"t":15029,"who":"@rooislangwtf","id":"UCVZP6kb7H3wfgCk5LqW2lAA","k":"milestone","tier":"IRySoCool","m":"Member for 45 months"},{"t":15133,"who":"@Yuu_kyaruchan","id":"UC_mjckTGbKJLKVx8Ov1X9zg","k":"sc","cur":"HK$","amt":50,"c":4294953512,"m":"HiRyS~ Just arrived Japan and really feels your sololive is actually soon! Can't wait to cheer for you in person on 6th! ライブ本当にめちゃくちゃ楽しみです！がんばって～全力で応援してます！:gem_stone::two_hearts:"},{"t":15191,"who":"@Nirvashe0027","id":"UCVbAcRh82gurUSYaiB-kAnA","k":"sc","cur":"₱","amt":2500,"c":4293271831,"m":"(silent read) I'll be flying off to Tokyo tomorrow & it's an understatement to say that I'm really nervous. But I'm even more excited for many things, especially to see you become the brightest st